    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "3\nAERO\n8\n4\n7 6 5\nCOMMUTER\nand CATALINA AIR LINES\nFLIGHT SCHEDULE\nEFFECTIVE JUNE 1, 1969\nNORTHERN CALIFORNIA\n3\n8\n1,\n2\n65\nTurbo Tet\nTOMORROW'S SERVICE TODAY!",
      "A WORD FROM\nTHE PRESIDENT\nCivic, business and industrial leaders\nrecognize that time saving aerial commuter\nservice has become essential to the move-\nment of people in metropolitan areas.\nSurface streets and freeways alone can no\nlonger handle the traffic volume.\nAero Commuter has been one of the\nnation's leaders in developing the type of\ncommuting that expedites travelers to their\ndestinations. Short-haul aerial commuting\nis becoming a way of life throughout Cali-\nfornia and our company is happy to be a\nvital force in the continuing development\nof this type of service.\nDel Futu\nCapt. Fred Austin\nPresident\nCOMMUTER\nAERO\n8\n6 5\nCOMMUTER\nCATALINA AIR LINES\nTOMORROW'S SERVICE...TODAY!\nFROM BAKERSFIELD Telephone (805) 393-1381\nFlight\nTO\nFRESNO\nFare: $10.50\nLeave\n7:00a\n5:30p\nArrive\n7:40a\n6:10p\nNo.\n902\n904\nFreq.\nDaily\nDaily\nOAKLAND\nFare: $22.00\n7:00c\n9:20a\n902\nDaily\nSACRAMENTO\nFare: $24.00\n7:00a\n5:30p\n8:40p\n7:15p\n902\n904\nDaily\nDaily\nSAN FRANCISCO\nFare: $23.00\n7:00a\n9:50a\n902.\nDaily\nFROM FRESNO Telephone (209) 255-3061\nTO\nBAKERSFIELD\nFare: $10.50\nLeave\n8:05a\n7:15p\nArrive\n8:45a\n7:55p\nFlight\nNo.\n901\n903\nFreq.\nDaily\nDaily\nOAKLAND\nFare: $20.00\n7:45c\n9:20a\n902\nDaily\nSACRAMENTO\nFare: $15.00\n7:45c\n6:200\n8:40cr\n7:15p\n902\n904\nDaily\nDaily\nSAN FRANCISCO\nFare: $20.00\n7:45 c\n9:50c\n902\nDaily\nFROM MERCED Telephone (209) 723-4263\nTO\nMODESTO\nFare: $7.00\nLeave\nArrive\n7:00c.\n7:20a\n12:00n\n12:20p\nFlight\nNo.\n702\n704\nFreq.\nDaily\nDaily\nMONTEREY\nFare: $23.00\n12:00n\n2:40p\n704/805\nDaily\nSAN FRANCISCO\nFare: $13.00\n7:00đ\n12:00n\n6:50p\n8:15a\n1:15p\n7:45p\n702\n704\n706\nDaily\nDaily\nDaily\nSTOCKTON\nFare: $10.00\n7:00ct\n6:50p\n9:20a\n8:55p\n702/711\n7061707\nDaily\nDaily\nALL TIMES LOCAL\nBAGGAGE AND PERSONAL LIABIL-\nITY: The liability of Aero Commuter for\nloss or damage to luggage or personal\nproperty, or for delay in delivery thereof,\nis limited to $500.00 unless a higher valua-\ntion is declared and an additional charge\npard.\nStops\n2\n3\nStops\n2\nStops"
